  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Duns">Duns</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Eac Dunsæte beþyrfan, gif heom se cyning an, þæt man huru friðgislas to heom læte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">The people of Dunsæte also need that peace-hostages at least be allowed, if the king grants them [the right].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Et Dunsetis expedit, si rex concedat, ut saltem friþgislas (id est pacis obsides) habeant.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
